<title>FINLAND: ELCOTEQ SAYS UPS PRINTEQ STAKE TO 91 PCT.</title>
<headline>ELCOTEQ SAYS UPS PRINTEQ STAKE TO 91 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronics component maker Elcoteq said on Thursday its holding in chip maker Printeq-Piirilevyt Oy rose to 91 percent after it acquired 40 percent of Printeq-Piirilevyt's shares from telecoms group Nokia Oy .</p>
<p>&quot;After the deal, Elcoteq holds 91 percent and Nokia Mobile Phones nine percent of shares in Printeq,&quot; Elcoteq said in a statement.</p>
<p>The price of the deal was not disclosed.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
